Create the first AscendKeep boss called The Hollow Crown.

Gameplay role:

* major Voidborn boss;
* slow;
* summons basic Voidlings;
* releases radial waves of corrupted energy;
* attacks the tower through several phases.

Design:

* massive circular Voidborn entity viewed directly from above;
* central hollow void surrounded by a broken crown-like ring;
* six large dark armored segments;
* intense violet core energy visible inside the hollow center;
* ancient muted gold fragments embedded in the armor, suggesting remnants of a consumed kingdom;
* several smaller orbiting void shards;
* imposing but clean silhouette;
* visually much larger than normal enemies;
* no humanoid king;
* no visible face;
* no handheld weapon;
* no environment.

The design should subtly suggest that the Void absorbs memories and architecture from destroyed civilizations.

